    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32683" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπλήρ-ωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
